"<div class="blog-content"><h2 id="drying-maize-safely" class="font-heading font-black text-zinc-900 scroll-mt-24 mt-10 mb-3 text-2xl"><span>Drying maize safely</span></h2><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Dry maize to </span><span><strong>13% moisture</strong></span><span> before storage. </span><span><em>Never</em></span><span> store it damp. </span><span><s>Old advice</s></span><span> — see the </span><span><a href="https://example.com/guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-moss-700 underline underline-offset-2">storage guide</a></span><span> and the </span><span><a href="/services">internal checklist</a></span><span>. Underlined </span><span><u>warning</u></span><span> and inline </span><span><code class="rounded bg-zinc-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.9em] text-zinc-800">moisture_meter</code></span><span>.</span></p><h3 id="before-storage" class="font-heading font-black text-zinc-900 scroll-mt-24 mt-8 mb-2 text-xl"><span>Before storage</span></h3><ul class="my-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-zinc-700"><li><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Dry on a raised rack</span></p></li><li><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Never dry on bare soil</span></p><ul class="my-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-zinc-700"><li><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Use a tarpaulin</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ol class="my-4 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-6 text-zinc-700"><li><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Sort the grain</span></p></li><li><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Test the moisture</span></p></li></ol><h4 id="a-note" class="font-heading font-black text-zinc-900 scroll-mt-24 mt-6 mb-2 text-lg"><span>A note</span></h4><blockquote cite="https://example.com/source" class="my-6 border-l-4 border-forest-moss-300 bg-zinc-50 py-2 pl-4 italic text-zinc-600"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Dry grain is safe grain.</span></p></blockquote><pre data-language="bash" class="my-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 p-4 text-sm text-zinc-100"><code><span>moisture --check maize.csv
echo done</span></code></pre><hr class="my-8 border-zinc-200"><div class="my-6 overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm"><tbody><tr><th class="border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-2 text-left font-semibold"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Step</span></p></th><th class="border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-2 text-left font-semibold"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Target</span></p></th></tr><tr><td class="border border-zinc-200 p-2 align-top"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Moisture</span></p></td><td class="border border-zinc-200 p-2 align-top"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>13%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="border border-zinc-200 p-2 align-top"><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Store off the floor</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class="my-8 mx-auto"><a href="https://example.com/photo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="Maize drying on a raised rack" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" class="h-auto w-full rounded-xl" src="/media/blog/2026/08/example.jpg"></a><figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-sm text-zinc-500"><span>Photo by </span><span><a href="https://example.com/jane" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-moss-700 underline underline-offset-2">Jane Doe</a></span><span> / </span><span><a href="https://example.com/source" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-moss-700 underline underline-offset-2">Source</a></span></figcaption></figure><p class="my-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700"><span>Line one</span><br><span>Line two</span></p></div>"
